es over the soft, contemporary narrative of the <a href=\"https://www.studiobagno.com.au/collection-organic\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Collection Organic</b></a> aesthetic with the addition of an internal tap landing and shelf, adding clever functionality to a gorgeous design. </div><div>The Nur 60x boasts a timeless, subtle design, including its trademark curve. A difficult shape to achieve with traditional ceramic production methods, the Nur60x is the perfect bench centerpiece for a contemporary bathroom. The basin  compatibility with our Milady Toilets and Nur or Lust Bath series creates an effortless design narrative. </div><div>The basin is available in matte white, matte black and the colours of the Alice Palette</div><div>Handmade in Italy.</div></div><div><b>Note:</b>32mm non-overflow plug &amp; waste not included.</div><div><b>Recommended Plug &amp; Waste: <a href=\"#/product/sku-sbw006-ro\">SBW006/RO</a></b><br/></div></div>","sourceRecordCount":1,"captureDate":"2026-11-01","availability":null}
